      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "8 dc-mesh sts x 10 rows = 10 x 10 cm after blocking."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern notes"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Every row: ch 4 (counts as dc, ch 1), dc in first ch-1 sp, (ch 1, dc) across, ch 2, (dc, ch 1, dc, ch 1, dc) in last sp (increase corner). The 3-dc cluster at the end adds 2 sts per row."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 6. Row 1: dc in 4th ch, ch 1, dc in last ch, ch 2, (dc, ch 1, dc, ch 1, dc) in last ch. Turn. (5 sts)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Every row: ch 4, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc-mesh-l10"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " in first ch-1 sp, (ch 1, dc) across row, ch 2, ("
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "asymmetric-shawl-l10"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "increase corner"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "): (dc, ch 1, dc, ch 1, dc) in last sp. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The row count increases by 2 mesh stitches each row. Work to approx. 55 cm at the longest edge (about 88 rows) or yarn is nearly used."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Border"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work 1 round of dc along all edges, placing 3 dc at the wide corner point. Join with slip stitch. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Weave in ends. Wet the shawl and pin it to shape with the angled edge straight. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "blocking-l10"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Blocking"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " sets the asymmetric outline and opens the mesh. Leave flat until dry."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
